Trapezoidal Rule:
$math{Area=h*((1/2)x_0+x_1+x_2+...+x_(n-1)+(1/2)x_n)}

Simpson's Rule (n even):
$math{Area=(1/3)h(x_0+4x_1+2x_2+4x_3+2x_4+...+2x_(n-2)+4x_(n-1)+x_n)}

Durand's Rule:
$math{Area=h((4/10)x_0+(11/10)x_1+x_2+x_3+...+x_(n-2)+(11/10)x_(n-1)+(4/10)x_n)}

Weddle's Rule (n=6):
$math{Area=(3/10)h(x_0+5x_1+x_2+6x_3+x_4+5x_5+x_6)}

